; The one fixture with NO *begin / *end of its own, so its stations
; arrive unqualified and collide with a cave's natives unless the
; exporter wraps the *include. Station names are chosen to match the
; natives its test gives the cave.
;
; The *fix makes a lost wrap loud: the cave's first native station is
; already auto-fixed at the origin, so an unwrapped "a1" here fixes it
; twice and cavern refuses the driver instead of merging in silence.
*fix a1 100 0 0
*data normal from to tape compass clino
a1 a2 5.0 0 0
